<title>USA: Hussey copper price rises to 125 cents/lb July 31.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price rises to 125 cents/lb July 31.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper  price was up three cents to 125.00 cents per lb. effective with shipments  of July 31. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
